# OMOP Cohort Workflow - Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values

# ============================================================================
# Required Credentials
# ============================================================================

# OpenAI API Key (Required for all AI agents)
# Get from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...your-key-here...

# ============================================================================
# Optional Credentials (for BigQuery)
# ============================================================================

# Google Cloud Project ID (Optional - for BigQuery SQL validation)
# Get from: https://console.cloud.google.com/
GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-project-id

# Path to Google Cloud service account key (Optional - alternative to gcloud auth)
# Create from: https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/serviceaccounts
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/path/to/service-account.json

# ============================================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================================

# 1. Never commit this file with real values to Git!
# 2. The workflow works without BigQuery credentials (SQL validation skipped)
# 3. For local development, you can use: gcloud auth application-default login
# 4. See CREDENTIALS_SETUP.md for detailed setup instructions
